  "question": {
    "text": "Words with or without meaning are to be formed using all the letters of the word <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>EXAMINATION</mi></math>. The probability that the letter <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>M</mi></math> appears at the fourth position in any such word is:",
